{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/10a5859d928270516d1d3470838b4907.avif?t=1758154174\" width=777 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f About AlberoquiSide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story of <strong>Alberoqui,</strong> a young man from a <strong>cursed clan</strong> searching for a way to reverse his fate before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of <strong>nostalgic pixel art</strong>, reminiscent of the classics you love, a <strong>dark battle</strong> is being waged. Here, the most <strong>dangerous enemies</strong> are the ones that <i>whisper in your mind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind these attacks: <strong>supernatural forces</strong> from a spiritual world that feed on human despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Your Journey Will Feature:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>A FRIEND UNTIL THE END:</strong> Jesus will be by your side. A presence\u00a0<strong>without religiosity</strong>. Your first and last friend... if you accept him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/5043a14a20a3547ba2bd856df7d8ba58.poster.avif?t=1758154174\" width=1052 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/5043a14a20a3547ba2bd856df7d8ba58.mp4?t=1758154174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTION AND REFLEXES:</strong> On the enemy's turn, your survival depends on your reflexes. Dodge patterns of attacks in a challenging action combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/73824f5192367182a83b49176f020ede.poster.avif?t=1758154174\" width=1052 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/73824f5192367182a83b49176f020ede.webm?t=1758154174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/73824f5192367182a83b49176f020ede.mp4?t=1758154174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRATEGIC EMOTIONAL RESPONSES:</strong> On your turn, understand the nature of each adversary and choose the right action to weaken them: Laugh, Ignore, Stay Calm...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/7f039729b52bb4c1dd34cac3fa04bf32.poster.avif?t=1758154174\" width=1052 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/7f039729b52bb4c1dd34cac3fa04bf32.webm?t=1758154174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/7f039729b52bb4c1dd34cac3fa04bf32.mp4?t=1758154174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOURNEY COMPANIONS:</strong> Travel alongside allies who offer support and companionship in the most difficult moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND PUZZLES:</strong> Use key items and solve puzzles to advance the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INNER PROGRESSION:</strong> Here, character growth isn't about levels, but about an inner maturation that develops with the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LINEAR STORY, PERSONAL JOURNEY:</strong> Follow a compelling and well-defined main storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUMOR IN THE DARKNESS:</strong> Nothing like a joke at the right time... or at the worst possible moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/extras/9d06ab83ee702244109d6e310edfc1af.avif?t=1758154174\" width=468 height=267 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND-DRAWN ART:</strong> Connect with unique character portraits, traditionally drawn on paper with colored pencils and ink pens.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560820?t=1758154174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/d81de8152efebb1699f36cb2266e5a4085679fd8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758154174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/24d92310660deddbac454f740cd109aed10ef4c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758154174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560820/24d92310660deddbac454f740cd109aed10ef4c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758154174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor